### maven-release-plugin ###
# Written into the repository root and beside every pom while a release is being cut, and normally
# cleaned up afterwards. Never commit release.properties: release:prepare defaults to resume=true, so a
# committed one would make the next release resume somebody else's half-finished attempt - with their
# preparationGoals, which is how a release could quietly skip its own test gate.
release.properties
pom.xml.releaseBackup
pom.xml.tag
pom.xml.next

