### Working design document ###
# The primos design record, deliberately kept out of git: the published history carries code,
# not the working document. Present in the working tree, never committed.
PLAN.md

### Agent guidance ###
# Kept out of git for the same reason as PLAN.md: it is working material about how to work on this
